problematic_fields.calibrated_vc_am:
synthetic from NetworkOutput (TestScenario); calibration pending; percent = 100 * calibrated volume / (ScenarioLinks capacity / period hours); unavailable or nonpositive capacities remain null; derivation reference: library-schema.json / CalibratedNetworkOutput / Calibrated V/C: PeriodHours_{Period,Link} = \begin{cases}
    3 & \text{if } Period=AM \\
    4   & \text{if } Period=PM \\
    6  & \text{if } Period=MD
    11 & \text{if }Period=OV
\end{cases}; V/C_{Period,Link} = \frac{CalibratedVolume_{Period,Link}}{Capacity_{Link}/PeriodHours_{Period,Link}}

